      "data": {
        "id": "input-router-agent",
        "type": "Agent",
        "node": {
          "template": {
            "agent_llm": {
              "display_name": "Agent LLM",
              "info": "LLM used by the routing agent",
              "type": "BaseChatModel",
              "required": true,
              "show": true
            },
            "system_prompt": {
              "display_name": "System Prompt",
              "type": "str",
              "value": "You are an Interview Trainer routing agent. Analyse the user's message and classify it into exactly one of these modes:\n\n- 'generate': The user wants new interview questions generated for their role\n- 'evaluate': The user has submitted a practice answer to an interview question and wants scored feedback\n- 'strategy': The user wants a personalised day-by-day preparation plan\n- 'full': The user wants a complete all-in-one report combining questions and strategy\n\nAlso extract these fields from the conversation context:\n- profile_name (str)\n- job_role (str)\n- experience_level: entry | mid | senior\n- target_company_type: startup | enterprise | big_tech | consulting | general\n- days_until_interview (int, default 14)\n- additional_context (str or null)\n- interview_question (str, only for evaluate mode)\n- candidate_answer (str, only for evaluate mode)\n\nReturn a JSON object with keys: mode, profile_name, job_role, experience_level, target_company_type, days_until_interview, additional_context, interview_question, candidate_answer.",
              "show": true
            },
            "input_value": {
              "display_name": "User Message",
              "type": "str",
              "required": true,
              "show": true
            },
            "tools": {
              "display_name": "Tools",
              "type": "list",
              "value": [],
              "show": true
            },
            "memory": {
              "display_name": "Memory",
              "type": "BaseChatMemory",
              "required": false,
              "show": true
            },
            "max_iterations": {
              "display_name": "Max Iterations",
              "type": "int",
              "value": 3,
              "show": true
            },
            "verbose": {
              "display_name": "Verbose",
              "type": "bool",
              "value": false,
              "show": false
            }
          },
          "display_name": "Input Router Agent",
          "description": "Classifies the user's intent into one of four modes (generate, evaluate, strategy, full) and extracts structured profile fields. Routes to the appropriate downstream specialist agent.",
          "base_classes": ["Agent", "AgentExecutor"],
          "outputs": [
            { "name": "response", "display_name": "Routing Decision (JSON)", "types": ["Message"] }
          ],
          "documentation": "https://docs.langflow.org/components/agents",
          "icon": "git-branch",
          "category": "agents"
